Package: kagu
Title: Bayesian Graphical Causal Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Jordan", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jordan@example.com")
Description: Fit Bayesian graphical causal models specified as directed acyclic
    graphs (DAGs). Each node's conditional distribution is fitted as an
    independent Bayesian model via brms, exploiting the Markov blanket
    factorisation. Causal effects are estimated by propagating interventions
    forward through the structural model using the do-operator.
